          "decision": "include",
          "reason": "The paper directly addresses whether RAG improves factual accuracy and what limits that improvement, noting RALMs' superiority in factuality but inconsistent example-level performance, and identifying innate differences in knowledge sources and unpredictable reader model degeneration as key limiting factors.",
          "quoteId": "q5",
          "quoteHash": "993c7abfc3d0378442413e864f14fc90a8dffad580039cad0f28a0d2d273fc0e"
